## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates how data science can be applied to logistics and
supply-chain management.

The analysis focuses on delivery performance, logistics KPIs, predictive
analytics, segmentation and route optimization.

### Business Question

How can historical logistics data be used to identify delivery problems,
predict shipment risk and improve resource allocation?


